+
+- `sky_dawn.png`: Use case: stylized-concept. Asset: SLEEPER dawn sky and sea background plate for a 320x240 RGB555 demoscene film. Paint one 4:3 landscape image, preferably 1024x768, edge to edge. Coordinates are for the final 320x240 image: a perfectly level sea horizon at row 150 (62.5 percent of total image height). Sun centered around (194,122), a hand's width above horizon, slightly right of centre, a small soft #FFF0D0 disc. Broad luminous #F0A060 glow around sun and horizon fading upward to #78A0D0 at the very top. A few long thin horizontal cloud bars catching warm light, restrained and soft, ample quiet blue sky above. Below row 150 paint calm open sea with base color #304860 and a narrow warm broken vertical sun reflection extending down the sea below the sun. Quiet painterly matte plate, smooth broad gradients and broad soft water ripples, designed to survive 256-color indexing and five bits per channel at 320x240. No coast or landscape, no silhouettes, no boats, no buildings, no birds, no grain or fine texture, no text, no border, no watermark.
